        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Songs: \"She's a Woman\", \"I Feel Fine\"\n- People: The Beatles\n- Concepts: B-side, A-side, guitar feedback\n\nFacts:\n- The Beatles recorded \"She's a Woman\" as the B-side of the single \"I Feel Fine.\"\n- \"I Feel Fine\" is the A-side of that single.\n- \"I Feel Fine\" contains one of the first instances of guitar feedback on a pop record.",
